{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午11時許，警方接獲長沙灣永康街77號環薈中心一辦公室職員報案，指收到一封可疑信件，懷疑內有粉末。</p><p>警方到場經調查，通知爆炸品處理課到場處理。</p><p>據了解，上址是網媒「橙新聞」辦公室。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T07:22:12.718846+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:31:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T11:37:43.447588+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:17:38.701399+00:00","content_hash":"85db77fef892b084e767eb549fc7129317c49d7f11185557efdd04b2c2575ad3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}